                        <h1>Company Information</h1>

                        <p>Complete the general information about your organization to get started.</p>

                        <p>At the end of your general information you can pay the set-up fee to get started by cashApp, paypal, or credit card.</p>

                        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->
                        <h1>Confirmation</h1>

                        <p>After the completion of your organizations information you will recieve confirmation and will be contacted by a team member.</p>

                        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->

                        <h1>Funding</h1>

                        <p>Ad campaigns are required. After the initial set-up fee you will need to fund your ad campaign for the campaign duration you select.</p>

                        <!-- ####################################################################################################### -->

                        <h1>Fulfillment</h1>

                        <p>Once your ad campaign is set then you will be able to manage your ad campaign from the member dashboard.</p>

                        <p><a class="btn btn-md btn-primary" href="~/AdCompanyInfo.aspx">Get Started</a>&nbsp; <a class="btn btn-md btn-primary" href="~/Default.aspx">Return</a> </p>

